{
  "name": "disagreement_sparse_neighborhood_simple",
  "intuition": "Selects pairwise preferences with high prediction disagreement by comparing log probabilities for all pairs, filtering pairs where objective indicates a preference, avoiding complex top-k capping to ensure simplicity and compile stability.",
